      "description": "<p>Judge says actor and comedian faces ‘significant custodial term’ after being convicted of raping a woman and assaulting three others</p><p>Russell Brand has been found guilty of raping a fan and sexually assaulting three other women, ending a years-long legal saga that has raised questions about how he was able to commit his crimes at the height of his fame.</p><p>Brand, 51, was described during his trial as a ruthless, calculated and manipulative sexual predator. He was accused of raping women in a hotel room, in a bar toilet and at his luxury London townhouse. He sexually assaulted women in front of his entourage at their workplaces, at a radio station and TV studio.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/nov/05/russell-brand-found-guilty-rape-sexual-assault\">Continue reading...</a>",
